{
  "key": 30920,
  "messages": [
    {
      "id": "ViridianCity_Text_CanCarryMonsAnywhere",
      "en_US": [
        "Those Poké Balls at your waist!\n",
        "You have Pokémon, don’t you?\r",
        "It’s great that you can carry and\n",
        "use Pokémon anytime, anywhere."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "ViridianCity_Text_GymClosedWonderWhoLeaderIs",
      "en_US": [
        "This Pokémon Gym is always closed.\r",
        "I wonder who the Leader is?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "ViridianCity_Text_ViridiansGymLeaderReturned",
      "en_US": "Viridian Gym’s Leader returned!"
    },
    {
      "id": "ViridianCity_Text_WantToKnowAboutCaterpillarMons",
      "en_US": [
        "You want to know about the two\n",
        "kinds of caterpillar Pokémon?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "ViridianCity_Text_OhOkayThen",
      "en_US": "Oh, okay then!"
    },
    {
      "id": "ViridianCity_Text_ExplainCaterpieWeedle",
      "en_US": [
        "Caterpie has no poison,\n",
        "but Weedle does.\r",
        "Watch that your Pokémon aren’t\n",
        "stabbed by Weedle’s Poison Sting."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "ViridianCity_Text_GrandpaHasntHadCoffeeYet",
      "en_US": [
        "Oh, Grandpa!\n",
        "Don’t be so mean!\r",
        "I’m so sorry.\n",
        "He hasn’t had his coffee yet."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "ViridianCity_Text_GoShoppingInPewterOccasionally",
      "en_US": [
        "I go shopping in Pewter City\n",
        "occasionally.\r",
        "I have to take the winding trail in\n",
        "Viridian Forest when I go."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "ViridianCity_Text_ThisIsPrivateProperty",
      "en_US": [
        "I absolutely forbid you from\n",
        "going through here!\r",
        "This is private property!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "ViridianCity_Text_ShowYouHowToCatchMons",
      "en_US": [
        "Well, now, I’ve had my coffee, and\n",
        "that’s what I need to get going!\r",
        "Hm?\n",
        "What is that red box you have?\r",
        "Ah, so you’re working on your\n",
        "Pokédex.\r",
        "Then let me give you a word of\n",
        "advice.\r",
        "Whenever you catch a Pokémon,\n",
        "the Pokédex automatically updates\f",
        "its data.\r",
        "…You don’t know how to catch\n",
        "a Pokémon?\r",
        "I suppose I had better show you\n",
        "then!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "ViridianCity_Text_ThatWasEducationalTakeThis",
      "en_US": [
        "There! Now tell me, that was\n",
        "educational, was it not?\r",
        "And here, take this, too."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "ViridianCity_Text_WatchThatToLearnBasics",
      "en_US": [
        "If there’s something you don’t\n",
        "understand, watch that.\r",
        "It will teach you about the basics\n",
        "of being a Pokémon Trainer."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "ViridianCity_Text_WeakenMonsFirstToCatch",
      "en_US": [
        "Well, now, I’ve had my coffee, and\n",
        "that’s what I need to get going!\r",
        "But I made it too strong.\n",
        "It gave me a headache…\r",
        "Incidentally, are you filling your\n",
        "Pokédex?\r",
        "At first, focus on weakening the\n",
        "Pokémon before trying to catch it."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "ViridianCity_Text_HowsTeachyTVHelping",
      "en_US": [
        "Well, now, I’ve had my coffee, and\n",
        "that’s what I need to get going!\r",
        "But I made it too strong.\n",
        "It gave me a headache…\r",
        "Incidentally, is my old Teachy TV\n",
        "helping you?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "ViridianCity_Text_MyGrandsonOnTheShow",
      "en_US": [
        "Wahaha!\n",
        "It’s my grandson on the show!\r",
        "Since he’s the one doing the\n",
        "teaching, you’re bound to learn."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "ViridianCity_Text_TooBusyForTeachyTV",
      "en_US": [
        "Hm… You’re too busy to not even\n",
        "have the time for Teachy TV…\r",
        "Time is money, and neither should\n",
        "be ill spent…"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "ViridianCity_Text_CitySign",
      "en_US": [
        "Viridian City \n",
        "The Eternally Green Paradise"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "ViridianCity_Text_CatchMonsForEasierBattles",
      "en_US": [
        "Trainer Tips\r",
        "Catch Pokémon and expand your\n",
        "collection.\r",
        "The more you have, the easier it\n",
        "is to battle."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "ViridianCity_Text_MovesLimitedByPP",
      "en_US": [
        "Trainer Tips\r",
        "The battle moves of Pokémon are\n",
        "limited by their Power Points, PP.\r",
        "To replenish PP, rest your tired\n",
        "Pokémon at a Pokémon Center."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "ViridianCity_Text_GymSign",
      "en_US": "Viridian City Pokémon Gym"
    },
    {
      "id": "ViridianCity_Text_GymDoorsAreLocked",
      "en_US": "Viridian Gym’s doors are locked…"
    }
  ]
}
